sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant SvelteKit
    participant BetterAuth as Better Auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Browser->>SvelteKit: Sign in
    SvelteKit->>BetterAuth: Authenticate credentials
    BetterAuth->>DB: Read account, create session
    BetterAuth-->>Browser: Session cookie
    Browser->>SvelteKit: Request ticket
    SvelteKit->>BetterAuth: Validate session
    BetterAuth-->>SvelteKit: User and session
    SvelteKit->>SvelteKit: Check enabled, role, ownership
    SvelteKit->>DB: Authorized ticket query
    DB-->>SvelteKit: Ticket rows
    SvelteKit-->>Browser: Only allowed fields
